  "Stage 5": "Fase 5",
  "Stage 6": "Fase 6",
  "Illustrated homestead record-keeping scene with a grower, notebook and source documents": "Geïllustreerde toneel van rekordhouding op 'n opstal met 'n kweker, notaboek en brondokumente",
  "Illustrated homestead setting for practical farm record keeping": "Geïllustreerde opstalomgewing vir praktiese plaasrekordhouding",
  "Illustrated grower studying records at a homestead table": "Geïllustreerde kweker wat rekords by 'n opstaltafel bestudeer",
  "Illustrated growers discussing a paper plan beside a homestead garden; the drawing is illustrative, not surveyed": "Geïllustreerde kwekers wat 'n papierplan langs 'n opstaltuin bespreek; die tekening is illustratief, nie opgemeet nie",
  "Imaginary site in metres, with no real location. Plot A is only a reference for these source cards. Dimensions do not establish harvest, rights, safety or a planting recommendation.": "Denkbeeldige terrein in meter, sonder 'n regte ligging. Perseel A is slegs 'n verwysing vir hierdie bronkaarte. Afmetings stel nie oes, regte, veiligheid of 'n plantaanbeveling vas nie.",
  "This is a one-month records exercise, not a complete growing season or a forecast of yield.": "Dit is 'n rekordoefening van een maand, nie 'n volledige groeiseisoen of 'n vooruitskatting van opbrengs nie.",
  "Opening cash and every actual cash movement in the month are supplied; there are no other cash accounts or movements in this bounded case.": "Openingskontant en elke werklike kontantbeweging in die maand word verskaf; daar is geen ander kontantrekeninge of -bewegings in hierdie afgebakende gevallestudie nie.",
  "Opening harvested stock and customer balances are zero. There are no other harvests, sales, stock movements, invoice adjustments or refunds.": "Openingsvoorraad van oes en kliëntsaldo's is nul. Daar is geen ander oeste, verkope, voorraadbewegings, faktuuraanpassings of terugbetalings nie.",
  "The invoice is for the same accepted delivery as the delivery card; the payment is not another sale.": "Die faktuur is vir dieselfde aanvaarde aflewering as die afleweringskaart; die betaling is nie nog 'n verkoping nie.",
  "No tax calculation, registration status or compliant tax invoice is being assessed.": "Geen belastingberekening, registrasiestatus of belastingfaktuur wat aan die vereistes voldoen, word geassesseer nie.",
  "Production costs, stock values and full accounts are incomplete. No full profit or balance sheet can be established.": "Produksiekoste, voorraadwaardes en volledige rekeninge is onvolledig. Geen volle wins of balansstaat kan vasgestel word nie.",
  "The loan card confirms cash received and the same principal still owed at month end. No loan repayment occurs here. Terms and interest are not supplied: do not recommend this loan or assume it is free.": "Die leningskaart bevestig kontant ontvang en dieselfde kapitaal wat aan die einde van die maand steeds verskuldig is. Geen leningsterugbetaling vind hier plaas nie. Voorwaardes en rente word nie verskaf nie: moenie hierdie lening aanbeveel of aanneem dat dit gratis is nie.",
  "Packaging quote": "Verpakkingskwotasie",
  "Transport quote": "Vervoerkwotasie",
  "Basket purchase quote": "Kwotasie vir mandjie-aankoop",
  "Delivery quote": "Afleweringskwotasie",
  "Earlier growing costs are outside the supplied budget.": "Vroeëre groeikoste val buite die verskafde begroting.",
  "Water-service charge, stock values, equipment use and other full-period costs are not supplied.": "Waterdiensheffing, voorraadwaardes, toerustinggebruik en ander koste vir die volle tydperk word nie verskaf nie.",
  "The listed quotes are only included cash costs, not a complete cost of production.": "Die gelyste kwotasies is slegs ingeslote kontantkoste, nie 'n volledige produksiekoste nie.",
  "Basket resale alternative": "Alternatief van mandjie-herverkoop",
  "A separate alternative using the SAME opening cash, not an extra business that can also spend it. No completed sale or full profit is established.": "'n Aparte alternatief met DIESELFDE openingskontant, nie 'n ekstra besigheid wat dit ook kan spandeer nie. Geen voltooide verkoping of volle wins word vasgestel nie.",
  "taken for household food": "geneem vir huishoudelike kos",
  "Classroom buyer G": "Klaskamerkoper G",
  "Classroom buyer I": "Klaskamerkoper I",
  "Classroom buyer R": "Klaskamerkoper R",
  "A water delivery for the growing activity is confirmed. Its charge and supporting bill are missing. Nothing has yet been paid for this delivery.": "'n Waterlewering vir die groeiaktiwiteit is bevestig. Die heffing daarvan en die stawende rekening ontbreek. Niks is nog vir hierdie lewering betaal nie.",
  "Understand the people and the place": "Verstaan die mense en die plek",
  "An agreed brief, evidence notes and an existing-features map.": "'n Ooreengekome opdrag, bewysnotas en 'n kaart van bestaande kenmerke.",
  "Agree what the household needs": "Kom ooreen wat die huishouding nodig het",
  "Observe, ask and keep the source": "Neem waar, vra en hou die bron",
  "Make a base map you can trust": "Maak 'n basiskaart wat jy kan vertrou",
  "Read patterns and constraints": "Lees patrone en beperkings",
  "Analysis overlays and design questions with their missing checks.": "Ontledingsoorlegsels en ontwerpvrae met hul ontbrekende kontroles.",
  "Use zones and sectors for different questions": "Gebruik sones en sektore vir verskillende vrae",
  "Read water, access and seasons together": "Lees water, toegang en seisoene saam",
  "Turn observations into decisions worth testing": "Omskep waarnemings in besluite wat die moeite werd is om te toets",
  "Connect functions and compare options": "Verbind funksies en vergelyk opsies",
  "Connections, alternative concepts and a reasoned choice.": "Verbindings, alternatiewe konsepte en 'n beredeneerde keuse.",
  "Ask what each part needs and gives": "Vra wat elke deel nodig het en gee",
  "Make alternatives before choosing": "Maak alternatiewe voordat jy kies",
  "Choose with reasons, not decoration": "Kies met redes, nie versiering nie",
  "Develop and check the plan": "Ontwikkel en gaan die plan na",
  "A checked layout, connected systems and a readable plan set.": "'n Nagegaande uitleg, verbinde stelsels en 'n leesbare stel planne.",
  "Move from a concept to a measured layout": "Beweeg van 'n konsep na 'n gemete uitleg",
  "Check the connections before approving work": "Gaan die verbindings na voordat jy werk goedkeur",
  "Make a plan another person can read": "Maak 'n plan wat iemand anders kan lees",
  "Plan the work and ongoing care": "Beplan die werk en deurlopende versorging",
  "A feasible sequence, cost record and agreed care plan.": "'n Uitvoerbare volgorde, kosterekord en ooreengekome versorgingsplan.",
  "Decide what must happen first": "Besluit wat eerste moet gebeur",
  "Connect the drawing to quantities and money": "Verbind die tekening aan hoeveelhede en geld",
